  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS IOM PT 2025 &#x2013; Programme Manager WASH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The situation in Gaza and the wider Palestinian Territories is critical, especially regarding water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) services and water supply. Amid ongoing hostilities, the International Organization for Migration (IOM) is scaling up its emergency response and has requested additional remote expertise to support WASH partners through coordination and technical guidance. To strengthen this effort, the Dutch Disaster Risk REduction and Surge Support (DRRS) Programme is rapidly deploying an emergency WASH expert to join and complement the existing team on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
